          %p
            Lecture notes motivated by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partial+differential+equations"} partial differential equations
            appearing in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mathematical+physics"} mathematical physics
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cliff+P.+Burgess"}> Cliff P. Burgess
              , §10 in:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Primer on Partial Differential Equations for Physicists
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://physics.mcmaster.ca/~cburgess/Notes/mathphys.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Burgess-PDEs.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            In relation to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Knizhnik-Zamolodchikov+equation"} Knizhnik-Zamolodchikov equation
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+groups"} quantum groups
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Varchenko"}> Alexander Varchenko
                ,
