                %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confluent_hypergeometric_function"} confluent hypergeometric function
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Varchenko"}> Alexander Varchenko
                \:
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.unc.edu/Faculty/av/complete.htm"} list
                of publications
          %p There is also a far reaching elliptic generalization
